{"sourceUrl":"https://scst.suda.edu.cn/da/c4/c29555a711364/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:52.581348+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://scst.suda.edu.cn/da/c4/c29555a711364/page.htm","html":"<div><h2><strong><span><span>一、预推免报名相关事宜</span></span></strong></h2><h3><strong><span><span>（一）资格初审</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>请考生登录苏州大学研究生招生管理系统</span></span><a href=\"https://link.wtturl.cn/?target=http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn/logon&amp;scene=im&amp;aid=497858&amp;lang=zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"autolink\"><span><span>http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn/logon</span></span></a><span><span>，选择</span><span>“</span><span>全国优秀大</span></span><span>学生推免生预报名</span><span>” </span><span>通道，如实、完整填报全部个人信息（后续考核、招录相关通知将通过邮箱、手机号推送，请务必准确填写联系方式），按系统要求上传全部附件材料，提交前仔细核对信息，报名材料提交后不可修改，学院将分批次开展资格初审工作。</span></p><p><span><span>备注：</span>1.</span><span><span>计算机科学与技术学院预推免报名系统</span></span><span>暂定</span><span><span>开放时段：</span>2026<span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span><span>—8</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日，学院</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>根据实时报名</span></span><span>情况相应调</span><span><span>整；</span></span></p><p><span>     2.</span><span>资格</span><span><span>初审</span></span><span>通过的</span><span><span>考生需及时登录系统打印报名申请表，作为线下考核必备材料。</span></span></p><h3><strong><span><span>（二）线下</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>机试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>学院计划</span> 9<span>月组织</span></span><span>资格</span><span><span>初审通过</span></span><span>的</span><span><span>考生开展综合考核（复试），考核分为机试和面试两个环</span></span><span>节，机试安排细则如下：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>机试</span><span><span>时间：暂定</span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日；若分多批次组织考核，每位考生仅可参与其中一批次，</span></span><span>具体批次安排另行通知；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>机试</span><span><span>科目：计算机基础综合；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>机试内</span><span><span>容：基础程序设计、数据结构、算法；</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>机试</span><span><span>形式：线下</span></span><span>机房编程；</span></p><p><span>5. </span><span><span>答题语种：支持</span> C++<span>、</span><span>Python </span><span>二选一，不可同时使用两个语种作答，不同语种试题</span></span><span><span>相同</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>6. </span><span><span>机试方案：另行通知。</span></span></p><h3><strong><span><span>（三）面试考核</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>  机试通过的考生，</span></span><span>请</span><span><span>在学院规定时段参加面试</span></span><span>（另行通知），</span><span><span>综合考核全部通过者，方可获得我院推免资格。</span></span></p><h3><strong><span><span>（四）重要注意事项</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>仅在</span></span><span>苏州大学研究生院</span><span><span>预推免系统报名</span></span><span>，通过考核</span><span><span>取得</span></span><span>推免</span><span><span>资格不代表被最终录取，考生后</span></span><span><span>续必须登录教育部全国推免服务系统（网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://link.wtturl.cn/?target=https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm&amp;scene=im&amp;aid=497858&amp;lang=zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"autolink\"><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></a><span><span>）进行报名，在该系统内完成复试和录取接收确认等工作。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请考生持续关注苏州大学研究生院和我院官网公告，全程保持手机、电子邮箱通讯畅通，避</span></span><span>免错过考核、录取关键通知。</span></p><h3><strong><span><span>二、线上宣讲会安排</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>  为帮助全国优秀本科生全面了解苏州大学计算机科学与技术学院</span>2027<span>级推免（含直博）招</span></span><span><span>生政策、学科建设、导师团队</span></span><span>、学生培养等内容</span><span><span>，我院开设线上招生宣讲会，面向所有意向申报我院推免的本科生开放参与。</span></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>宣讲时间：</span>2026 <span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日（星期一）</span><span>13:</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span>0—17:00</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>宣讲平台：腾讯会议</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>宣讲流程及内容</span></span></p><p><span>               （1）</span><span><span>学院院长整体介绍学院</span></span><span><span>情况</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>      （2）</span><span><span>导师代表</span></span><span><span>介绍</span></span><span>其</span><span><span>研究方向、招生需求；</span></span></p><p><span>      （3）</span><span><span>在读研究生分享经验；</span></span></p><p><span>      （4）</span><span><span>学院党委书记</span></span><span>作</span><span><span>总结</span></span><span>讲话</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>4. </span><span><span>参会操作要求</span></span></p><p><span><span>参会学生须在</span> 2026 <span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日前完成实名验证并加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span><span>1057468799</span><span>；宣讲会前，群内统一发布腾讯会议号、入会密码，请提前安装腾讯会议客户端。</span></span></p><h3><strong><span><span>三、咨询渠道</span></span></strong></h3><p><span><span>  咨询邮箱：</span>jygl1203@suda.edu.cn <span>咨询电话：</span><span>0512-65241071</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"b6f7d33313a71b42b7ba726d7836593bf46b60c8f7bd7b12e6ba19ff15f7bf67","textLength":1095,"sourceSha256":"040cd79f5023f6123bc226d29dbf05a5ec6e661995e136a5fdb82c3461e2e194","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6fea0d69bcee08f196d4","title":"2026年苏州大学计算机科学与技术学院2027级推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预推免报名及2026年研究生招生线上宣讲会安排通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:52.581348+00:00"}
